al","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p016","quote":"二十五年，惠公怨周之容舍黔牟，與燕伐周。周惠王奔温，衞、燕立惠王弟穨爲王。二十九年，鄭復納惠王。三十一年，惠公卒，子懿公赤立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p017","quote":"懿公卽位，好鶴，淫樂奢侈。九年，翟伐衞，衞懿公欲發兵，兵或畔。大臣言曰：「君好鶴，鶴可令撃翟。」翟於是遂入，殺懿公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p018","quote":"懿公之立也，百姓大臣皆不服。自懿公父惠公朔之讒殺太子伋代立至於懿公，常欲敗之，卒滅惠公之後而更立黔牟之弟昭伯頑之子申爲君，是爲戴公。戴公申元年卒。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","quote":"初，翟殺懿公也，衞人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公爲君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔牟皆已前死，故立昭伯子申爲戴公。戴公卒，復立其弟燬爲文公。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與追稱、衛世系及具體事件暫定所列提及同指；每段原文附存，不按同名字面跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p016","text":"二十五年，惠公怨周之容舍黔牟，與燕伐周。周惠王奔温，衞、燕立惠王弟穨爲王。二十九年，鄭復納惠王。三十一年，惠公卒，子懿公赤立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"黔牟","kind":"person","person_id":"78j_6yv_eaf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"周惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"穨","kind":"person","person_id":"gdy_039_7n5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"懿公赤","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_CA","status":"conte